 **Edge Cases and Pitfalls:**
-*   **Axis Alignment:** Standard cross-sectional images can only be made across the x, y, and z axes. If the data is not aligned well with these axes, the result may be poor unless the Data Rotate Filter is used [S4].
-*   **Preview vs. Render:** The filtering operations (including clipping and transparency) are applied in the preview environment. They do not automatically persist to the final PovRay rendering unless the data is exported [S4].
